message: "If you use or reference this software architecture in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Universal Brain 3D v2.1 & InkBlitz 3D: Closed-Loop Asynchronous Functionalist Whole-Brain Cognitive Architecture for Partially Observable 3D Environments"
version: 2.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-21"
license: GPL-3.0-only
authors:
