abstract: >-
  A domain-agnostic, 60 Hz closed-loop functionalist whole-brain cognitive engine (v2.1)
  paired with InkBlitz 3D, a symmetric 3D paint-territory and core-escort research simulator.
  Integrates a 7-process lock-free SeqLock+CRC32 architecture (strict single-GPU Barrier 1),
  4-layer allocentric hippocampal spatial memory with stationary-landmark EKF-SLAM,
  cerebellar 3D ballistic lead-aim, basal ganglia STN-SNr timing inhibition, a 3-head
  categorical RSSM world model with counterfactual de-confounding, metastable GNWT
  broadcasting with top-down perceptual/hippocampal feedback, Oizumi-2016 lagged causal
  integrated information (Phi_G), Plan-A motor-isolated inner speech, and 4-phase sleep
  consolidation (S-1 to S-4).
